{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09674","headline":"青门歌送东台张判官 · 岑参","name":"青门歌送东台张判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青门金锁平旦开，城头日出使车回。\n青门柳枝正堪折，路傍一日几人别。\n东出青门路不穷，驿楼官树灞陵东。\n花扑征衣看似绣，云随去马色疑骢。\n胡姬酒垆日未午，丝绳玉缸酒如乳。\n灞头落花没马蹄，昨夜微雨花成泥。\n黄鹂翅湿飞转低，关东尺书醉嬾题。\n须臾望君不可见，扬鞭飞鞚疾如箭。\n借问使乎何时来，莫作东飞伯劳西飞燕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09674.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09674","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}